---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Dan McSpirit">
  <div id="shell">
    <!-- IDENTITY COLUMN -->
    <aside class="col col-identity">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div class="name">Dan McSpirit</div>
        <div class="metadata">Denver, Colorado</div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 18px;">Advisor | Builder | Teacher</div>

      <h1 style="margin-bottom: 26px;">
        Closing the gap. <br class="mbreak" />
        Creating value.
      </h1>

      <!-- Portrait Card -->
      <div style="display: flex; height: 260px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper-dark); margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div
          style="position: relative; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 24px 18px 24px 22px;"
        >
          <div class="caption" style="margin-bottom: 9px;">Principal</div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.18; color: var(--ink);">
            Otherwhere Capital
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          style="position: relative; flex: 0 0 58%; background: url('/portrait-sketch.png') center top / cover no-repeat;"
        >
          <div
            style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--paper-dark) 0%, rgba(237, 231, 217, 0) 27%);"
          ></div>
          <div
            style="position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 72px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(237, 231, 217, 0) 0%, var(--paper-dark) 100%);"
          ></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Body Prose -->
      <p style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
        How capital is allocated determines whether value gets created or destroyed. I work as an advisor to founders and builder of analytical tools to direct it toward its highest returning use. I bring that same discipline to substitute teaching to help students close the gap between where they are and where they could be.
      </p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <!-- Hard-won Truth -->
      <div class="section-label muted" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Hard-won truth</div>
      <blockquote style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
        "Finance golden rule: You can't get somethin' for nothin'."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="body-sm" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        Risk and return are inextricably linked; if you can't see the risk, you haven't looked hard enough.
      </p>

      <div style="height: 1px; background: var(--rule); margin: 0 0 24px;"></div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <div class="section-label muted" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Contact</div>
      <a href="mailto:mcspiritdaniel@gmail.com" class="lnk" style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        mcspiritdaniel@gmail.com
      </a>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em;">
        <a href="https://x.com/danmcspirit" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
          X ↗
        </a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/danmcspirit" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
          LinkedIn ↗
        </a>
        <span style="color: var(--faint);">© 2026</span>
      </div>

      <div style="height: 46px;"></div>
      <div class="scrollfade"></div>
    </aside>

    <!-- WORK COLUMN -->
    <section class="col col-work">
      <div class="stickyhead">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span class="col-header-label">Experience</span>
          <span class="scrollcue">scroll ↓</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subtitle">
          The thread through every role: a pull toward steep learning curves and a habit of leading the climb.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pad">
        <!-- Advisory & Investing Section -->
        <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Advisory & Investing</div>

        <!-- Otherwhere Capital Entry -->
        <div style="padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2DACA;">
          <div class="work-date" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">2019 — Present</div>
          <h2 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">Otherwhere Capital</h2>
          <div class="work-role" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Principal | Private Capital Advisory</div>
          <div class="body-sm">
            Partner to founders — building the financial architecture, creating the capitalization strategy, and constructing the models and valuation analyses that steer value-creating growth — while actively investing in public and private entities. Co-founded a manufacturing operation earlier in this chapter.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Capital Markets Section -->
        <div class="section-label muted" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Capital Markets</div>

        <!-- BMO Capital Markets Entry -->
        <div style="padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2DACA;">
          <div class="work-date muted" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">2004 — 2019</div>
          <h2 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">BMO Capital Markets</h2>
          <div class="work-role" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Director | Institutional Equity Research</div>
          <div class="body-sm">
            Provided institutional-grade valuation and investment analysis for a portfolio of publicly traded companies, advising global asset managers on capital allocation.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- First Albany Entry -->
        <div style="padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">
          <div class="work-date muted" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">1996 — 2004</div>
          <h2 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">First Albany Corporation</h2>
          <div class="work-role" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Senior Associate | Investment Banking & Analyst | CFO Office</div>
          <div class="body-sm">Executed middle-market transactions, including debt and equity capital raises and M&A&D mandates, and supported firm-wide financial strategy.</div>
        </div>

        <!-- In the Classroom Section -->
        <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">In the Classroom</div>

        <div style="background: var(--paper-dark); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 3px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 34px;">
          <h3 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Denver Public Schools</h3>
          <p class="body-sm">
            Currently a Guest Teacher in the DPS system. Teaching pulls on the same instinct as the work: take something complex, find the first principle, and make it usable. The most honest test of whether you understand an idea is whether you can hand it to someone else.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Education Section -->
        <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Education & Credentials</div>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          <div class="body-sm">
            <span style="color: var(--navy); margin-right: 8px;">
              •
            </span>
            The Wharton School (WMP21)
          </div>
          <div class="body-sm">
            <span style="color: var(--navy); margin-right: 8px;">
              •
            </span>
            CFA Charter
          </div>
          <div class="body-sm">
            <span style="color: var(--navy); margin-right: 8px;">
              •
            </span>
            CMA Certificate
          </div>
          <div class="body-sm">
            <span style="color: var(--navy); margin-right: 8px;">
              •
            </span>
            FSA Credential
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Community Involvement Section -->
        <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Community Involvement</div>

        <div style="padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2DACA;">
          <div class="work-date muted" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">2025 — Present</div>
          <h2 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">ICMA Exam Review Committee Member</h2>
          <div class="work-role" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">IMA | Institute of Management Accountants</div>
          <div class="body-sm">Help shape the rigor and relevance of the Certified Management Accountant (CMA) certification by reviewing and developing exam content.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2DACA;">
          <div class="work-date muted" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">2021 — 2023</div>
          <h2 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">Foundation Board Member & Investment Program Advisor</h2>
          <div class="work-role" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Upcycled Food Association</div>
          <div class="body-sm">Guided financial strategy and provided board governance for a mission-driven organization dedicated to sustainable food systems.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 46px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">
          <div class="work-date muted" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">2021 — 2022</div>
          <h2 class="work-title" style="margin-bottom: 4px;">FSA Level II Subject Matter Expert</h2>
          <div class="work-role" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">IFRS Foundation</div>
          <div class="body-sm">Developed sustainability exam content ensuring technical rigor and real-world practitioner relevance.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="scrollfade"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROJECTS COLUMN -->
    <section class="col col-projects">
      <div class="stickyhead">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <span class="col-header-label" style="color: var(--ink);">Featured Projects</span>
          <span class="scrollcue">scroll ↓</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subtitle">
          Institutional-grade analysis and insights, deepened and expressed through AI-powered tools.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pad">
        <!-- Project 1: SBET Build Process -->
        <div class="pcard" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 34px; margin-bottom: 52px;">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 270px; min-width: 240px;">
            <h2 class="project-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">What It Actually Takes to Trust AI-Built Analysis</h2>
            <a href="/sbet-build-process.pdf" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
              view ↗
            </a>
            <p class="pcard-body" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              An account of building an institutional-grade valuation model with AI, and of the eight times it was wrong. Not one was an arithmetic error. Every one was a claim about the output — a stale figure from an earlier build, a crossed reference, a share basis that didn't match the line beside it. What caught them was a regression harness, a second AI system with no stake in the first one's conclusions, and review. The work didn't shrink; it moved from construction to verification.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="tag">claude chat + design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 350px; min-width: 300px;">
            <a
              href="/sbet-build-process.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              style="display: block; border: 1px solid var(--rule-light); border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; padding: 20px; background: #fafaf9;"
            >
              <div
                style="height: 34px; background: #F2EFE8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 0 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: -20px -20px 20px -20px;"
              >
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--warm-tan); margin-left: 8px;">
                  ai-built verification practice
                </span>
              </div>
              <img
                src="/screenshots/sbet-build-process.png"
                alt="What It Actually Takes to Trust AI-Built Analysis"
                style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px;"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: SBET Absolute Valuation -->
        <div class="pcard" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 34px; margin-bottom: 52px;">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 270px; min-width: 240px;">
            <h2 class="project-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">SBET Absolute Valuation</h2>
            <a href="https://sbet-absolute-valuation.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
              view ↗
            </a>
            <p class="pcard-body" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              Digital asset treasury companies get valued on ETH per share, a metric that rises on any buyback at any price and never registers a dollar of operating expense. This model puts NAV per share beside it and prices the warrant stack properly — treasury stock method where warrants are in the money, a Black-Scholes deduction where they are not. The anchor is what SBET is worth if management never touches the capital markets again; everything above that line is what you are paying for the machine.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); margin-bottom: 12px;">Best viewed on desktop</p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="tag">ms excel</span>
              <span class="tag">claude chat + design + code</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 350px; min-width: 300px;">
            <a
              href="https://sbet-absolute-valuation.vercel.app/"
              target="_blank"
              style="display: block; border: 1px solid var(--rule-light); border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s;"
            >
              <div
                style="height: 34px; background: #F2EFE8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 0 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"
              >
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--warm-tan); margin-left: 8px;">
                  sbet-absolute-valuation.vercel.app
                </span>
              </div>
              <img
                src="/screenshots/sbet-absolute-valuation.png"
                alt="SBET Absolute Valuation"
                style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%;"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: Neocloud Asset Life -->
        <div class="pcard" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 34px; margin-bottom: 52px;">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 270px; min-width: 240px;">
            <h2 class="project-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">CRWV & NBIS: The Debate Is Depreciation. The Difference Is Funding.</h2>
            <a href="/neocloud-asset-life.pdf" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
              view ↗
            </a>
            <p class="pcard-body" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              Whether book life reflects the economic life of the hardware is now central to the AI infrastructure trade. Nowhere more so than in neoclouds, the specialized cloud providers that help make AI possible.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="tag">ms excel</span>
              <span class="tag">claude design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 350px; min-width: 300px;">
            <a
              href="/neocloud-asset-life.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              style="display: block; border: 1px solid var(--rule-light); border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; padding: 20px; background: #fafaf9;"
            >
              <div
                style="height: 34px; background: #F2EFE8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 0 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: -20px -20px 20px -20px;"
              >
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--warm-tan); margin-left: 8px;">
                  neocloud asset life presentation
                </span>
              </div>
              <img
                src="/screenshots/neocloud-asset-life.png"
                alt="CRWV & NBIS: The Debate Is Depreciation. The Difference Is Funding."
                style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px;"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: Hyperscaler Capex vs ROIC -->
        <div class="pcard" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 34px; margin-bottom: 52px;">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 270px; min-width: 240px;">
            <h2 class="project-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">The AI Capex Question: Value or Mirage</h2>
            <a href="/hyperscaler-capex-roic.pdf" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
              view ↗
            </a>
            <p class="pcard-body" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              Five companies — Google, Microsoft, Meta, Amazon, Oracle — are pouring unprecedented capital into AI infrastructure. Growth isn't the question. Value creation is.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="tag">ms excel</span>
              <span class="tag">claude design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 350px; min-width: 300px;">
            <a
              href="/hyperscaler-capex-roic.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              style="display: block; border: 1px solid var(--rule-light); border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; padding: 20px; background: #fafaf9;"
            >
              <div
                style="height: 34px; background: #F2EFE8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 0 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: -20px -20px 20px -20px;"
              >
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--warm-tan); margin-left: 8px;">
                  hyperscaler roic presentation
                </span>
              </div>
              <img
                src="/screenshots/hyperscaler-capex-roic.png"
                alt="Hyperscaler Capex vs ROIC"
                style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px;"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: Valuing Ethereum Presentation -->
        <div class="pcard" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 34px; margin-bottom: 52px;">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 270px; min-width: 240px;">
            <h2 class="project-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Valuing Ethereum: The Agentic Upside</h2>
            <a href="/eth-valuation-analysis.pdf" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
              view ↗
            </a>
            <p class="pcard-body" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              Valuing Ethereum's potential in the agentic economy. Our approach is a five segment valuation model that treats ETH as programmable infrastructure. Includes sensitivities on what AI agent settlement could do to the valuation.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="tag">ms excel</span>
              <span class="tag">claude design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 350px; min-width: 300px;">
            <a
              href="/eth-valuation-analysis.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              style="display: block; border: 1px solid var(--rule-light); border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; padding: 20px; background: #fafaf9;"
            >
              <div
                style="height: 34px; background: #F2EFE8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 0 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: -20px -20px 20px -20px;"
              >
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--warm-tan); margin-left: 8px;">
                  eth valuation analysis presentation
                </span>
              </div>
              <img
                src="/screenshots/eth-valuation-presentation.png"
                alt="Valuing Ethereum: The Agentic Upside"
                style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px;"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: SPCX Analysis - Four Businesses -->
        <div class="pcard" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 34px; margin-bottom: 52px;">
          <div style="flex: 1 1 270px; min-width: 240px;">
            <h2 class="project-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Valuing SPCX: Four Businesses, Four Costs of Capital</h2>
            <a href="/spcx-valuation-analysis.pdf" target="_blank" class="lnk" style="font-size: 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
              view ↗
            </a>
            <p class="pcard-body" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              SpaceX is more than one business, and each carries its own risk. This presentation introduces a sum-of-the-parts valuation of Space, Connectivity, AI, and Expansion, each priced at its own cost of capital rather than blended into a single company-wide discount rate.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span class="tag">ms excel</span>
              <span class="tag">claude design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1 1 350px; min-width: 300px;">
            <a
              href="/spcx-valuation-analysis.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              style="display: block; border: 1px solid var(--rule-light); border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; padding: 20px; background: #fafaf9;"
            >
              <div
                style="height: 34px; background: #F2EFE8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 0 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: -20px -20px 20px -20px;"
              >
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <div style="width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DAD3C5;"></div>
                <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--warm-tan); margin-left: 8px;">
                  spcx valuation analysis presentation
                </span>
              </div>
              <img
                src="/screenshots/spcx-analysis-breakdown.png"
                alt="SPCX Valuation: Four Businesses Analysis"
                style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 20px;"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
